@startuml
title Get Appointment By ID

actor Client
participant "Express Router" as Router
participant "AppointmentController\n(getById)" as Ctrl
participant "AppointmentService\n(getByIdAsync)" as Svc
database "MongoDB" as DB

Client -> Router: GET /api/appointments/:id
Router -> Ctrl: getById(req, res)
Ctrl -> Svc: getByIdAsync(req.params.id)

Svc -> DB: Appointment.findById(id)\n + populate doctor(user), specialty, clinic
DB --> Svc: data

Svc --> Ctrl: data
Ctrl --> Client: 200 JSON { ok: true, data }

@enduml
